  Nickname: 
  Occupation: Taxi Driver
  CharacterDescription: Confident, slightly aggressive and macho  tone. Mid 30's
    male just trying to get by, but comes off as a arrogant and easily aggravated.
    Clearly has anger issues and unresolved traumas.
  CharacterArc: 'His arc is one of explosive frustration; as the world stops making
    sense and his cab becomes useless, he directs his rage at the only thing he can
    still control: his interactions with the checkpoint.'
  DateOfBirth: 28/12/1963
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 25 SEP
  IsResident: 1
  GivesPaperwork: 1
  handwritingFont: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f8e89ead54f8523428cc2e34f005bb5e, type: 2}
